// DECLARED `secret<T>`, but only where `place_struct_type` could resolve the base — which in
// practice meant a VARIABLE. Reading the field straight off a CALL RESULT resolved to nothing, so
// the same declaration was silently ignored one composition step further out. Runtime-proven: check
